6_algorithm_procedure:
Delete Given Node X (without head traversal):
1. If X->prev != NULL: X->prev->next = X->next;
2. If X->next != NULL: X->next->prev = X->prev;
3. free(X);

Insert at End in CDLL (given head):
1. Allocate new_node.
2. If head == NULL: new_node->next = new_node->prev = new_node; head = new_node;
3. Else:
   - tail = head->prev;
   - new_node->next = head;
   - new_node->prev = tail;
   - tail->next = new_node;
   - head->prev = new_node;
4. Return head.

