Enqueue Algorithm in Circular Queue:
1. If (rear + 1) % MAX == front: Print 'Queue Overflow' and exit.
2. If front == -1: front = rear = 0;
3. Else: rear = (rear + 1) % MAX;
4. queue[rear] = value.

